WEBVTT
NOTE Language: en

1
00:00:00 --> 00:00:09
I wrote to the Rebbe, and the Rebbe sent back a letter, first wishing her to have an easy pregnancy and delivery,

2
00:00:09 --> 00:00:16
and the baby should be well, and then there was the P.S., and the P.S. was,

3
00:00:16 --> 00:00:28
the lesson from the episode that you wrote to me about,

4
00:00:28 --> 00:00:36
the greatness of alacrity, of zwizos, of swiftness, schnellkeit, in all matters of goodness, not just teiromitzos,

5
00:00:36 --> 00:00:40
whenever it comes to something good, do it with great zwizos, great alacrity, great zest, and don't procrastinate.
